{"id":"40b00bc10cced0e5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-extension.md","title":"GL Extension","display":"df-gl-extension — GL Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-extension","aliases":["89-df-gl-extension"],"display":"df-gl-extension — GL Extension","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-extension — GL Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL},S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL},S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元扩张谓词，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，基础逻辑固定为上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in S\\land(A\\to B)\\in S)\\to B\\in S)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in S\\to\\Box A\\in S)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in S\\land(A\\to B)\\in S)\\to B\\in S)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in S\\to\\Box A\\in S)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL扩展包含GL的所有定理</li>\n<li>GL扩展保持GL的基本性质</li>\n<li>GL扩展可能添加新公理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-b